Round being raised: Series A. Every threshold below is stated for this round.

PARAMETERS
  "IB_SECTOR_DEALS" - Deals Closed in Sector (G.1)
    Definition: Deals we have closed in this sector in the last three years, supported by the count of warm investor relationships active in the sub-sector.
    Where to look: Internal — our own deal log and investor CRM. Closed deals only; mandates that did not complete do not build a track record.
    Report "value" as a number in Count.
    Scored at Series A (higher is better): Excellent 3.0000, Good 2.0000, Fair 1.0000.
