  "IB_GTM_WEEKS" - Weeks to Launch GTM (G.2)
    Definition: Weeks from mandate signing to being in market with materials. Driven by data-room readiness, audit quality and how much of the model we have to rebuild.
    Where to look: Judged from the quality of the pack you have just read — an unauditable model or missing statements adds weeks.
    Report "value" as a number in Weeks.
    Scored at Series A (lower is better): Excellent 4.0000, Good 8.0000, Fair 12.0000.
