    Where to look: Not in the model — news search on the named peers, plus Sector Deal Data for recorded rounds.
    Report "value" as a number in Count.
    Scored at Series A (higher is better): Excellent 5.0000, Good 3.0000, Fair 1.0000.
    If the data is missing: If peer news is materially negative — shutdowns, down rounds, fraud — score Poor on the anchors regardless of the count, and list the events.
