    Definition: Ratio of positive to negative sector news events over the last six months. Below 1.0x the sector is generating more bad news than good.
    Where to look: Not in the model — sector news search over a defined six-month window. State the window and cite the sources.
    Report "value" as a number in x.
    Scored at Series A (higher is better): Excel
